#
# SAMPLE kf3 flag set for `win_vm.sh run --env-file scripts/bench/windows/kf3_flags.sample.env`.
# Written 2026-10-31. Only blank lines, '#' comments and KF3_NAME=digits lines are accepted; anything else
# refuses the file (win_vm.sh load_env_file).
#
# !! UNSURE -- NOT confirmed as "the production list" !!  Before a lease, confirm every line against `next`
# (and against docs/OWNER_RULINGS.md / docs/STATUS_AND_HANDOFF.md, which say whether a flag-free default route
# is now the production route). This file does NOT decide what production means; the owner does.
#
# Source of the 19 lines below: the flag list of the recorded Windows "Code 0" holds,
# traces/sweep_windows_20261021/p19.flags on branch claude/bw4-b1n-20261024 (read 2026-10-31). All 19 names
# were found read by crates/ or qemu/ on `next` the same day (a name match only: not their defaults, not their
# meaning). Without any such flags the guest driver was refused GFX_POOL_QUERY_SIZE (0x2080121f) and ended in
# Code 43 (MEASURED 2026-10-27, lease 57882297, traces/tur1_20261027/run3_windows/w4_refused_set_no_flags.txt).
#
# NOT in this list, and not decided here: the lazy-observe, mirror and pointer-lifecycle settings the owner's
# 2026-10-26 rule says correctness runs must have on (KF3_LAZY_OBSERVE and KF3_LIFECYCLE_MODE exist in
# crates/kf-qemu/src/userpump.rs; whether they are on by default was not checked). Add them here once confirmed.
# The owner-host list windows_broker_prod2.sh also carries KF3_TIMER_MAP, which no crate on `next` reads.
#
# `run` logs this file's name, sha256 prefix and flag count (ENV_FILE) and the resulting KF3_* environment
# (KF3_ENV) so the flag set is part of the evidence. KF3_RPC_TRACE=1 is still set by `run` unless this file or
# --no-rpc-trace says otherwise.
KF3_WIN_USER_CHANNELS_PASSTHROUGH=1
KF3_WIN_TWIN_DEFAPI_OBJECT=1
KF3_KERNEL_GR_CE=1
KF3_KERNEL_GR_WORK=1
KF3_TRANSLATED_CE_RELAY=1
KF3_DEFERRED_API=1
KF3_PREEMPT_BIND_PROBE=1
KF3_DISPLAY_IMP_ENABLE=1
KF3_DISPLAY_CTRL_PROBE=1
KF3_ZCULL_BIND_PROBE=1
KF3_SW_RUNLIST_HOST_OWNED=1
KF3_ASYNC_PREEMPT=1
KF3_GFX_POOL_PROBE=1
KF3_SW_RUNLIST_PROBE=1
KF3_MEMORY_LIST_PROBE=1
KF3_DISPLAY_SDR_COLOR=1
KF3_DISPLAY_CAPS_PROBE=1
KF3_DISPLAY_LUT_MIRROR=1
KF3_DISPLAY_ILUT_OFFSET_256=1
